  "statement": "Design a hospital clinical database. A Ward has many Beds, and a Patient is admitted to one Bed at a time. Each Patient can have multiple Encounters attended by a Doctor (a Doctor attends many Encounters). During an Encounter, a Doctor may place multiple Lab Orders, and each Lab Order references a Lab Test from the hospital catalog.",
  "deliverables": [],
  "hints": [
    "Ward (1) -> Bed (N) -> Patient (1) models bed assignment.",
    "Encounter acts as the central visit record linking Patient (1:N) and Doctor (1:N).",
    "LabOrder links Encounter (1:N) with LabTest (1:N)."
  ],
